<!-- §2 痛點 vs 改善 -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="line-pill">生長線 No.06</span>
      <h2>水產育成痛點與改善對策</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-fix-grid">
      <div class="pain-col">
        <h3>▌ 現況痛點</h3>
        <div class="pain-row"><span class="icon">✕</span><span>蝦苗成活率低——幼苗期死亡率高，整批育成率不穩</span></div>
        <div class="pain-row"><span class="icon">✕</span><span>白便症 / 肝胰腺問題——飼料蛋白利用不足，腸道與肝胰腺負擔重</span></div>
        <div class="pain-row"><span class="icon">✕</span><span>生長緩慢——料肉比偏高，增重速度不達預期</span></div>
        <div class="pain-row"><span class="icon">✕</span><span>空腹死亡 / 採食不穩——腸道健康差，應激敏感性高</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-col">
        <h3>▌ 活力得®保苗旺 改善方向</h3>
        <div class="fix-row"><span class="icon">✓</span><span>高效分解飼料蛋白——小肽+游離胺基酸供給充足，生長加速</span></div>
        <div class="fix-row"><span class="icon">✓</span><span>V/C 比優化腸道健康——腸絨毛發育改善，白便風險降低</span></div>
        <div class="fix-row"><span class="icon">✓</span><span>肝胰腺支持——減少未消化蛋白積累，降低肝臟負擔</span></div>
        <div class="fix-row"><span class="icon">✓</span><span>提升育成率——苗期死亡率降低，整批成活率提升</span></div>
      </div>
